    "description": "Class III, mains or battery-operated, self-indicating, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instrument. It consists of a CI-200 Series indicator connected to a weighing platform. Devices include: initial zero setting device on power up, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking (optional), semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, zero-indicator, indication of stable equilibrium, net indicator, gravity compensation, printing, hold function, counting mode (CI-201A), percent mode (CI-201A), totalisation (CI-201A), checkweighing (CI-201A and CI-200SC)."
